Description: A cross-platform disk space analyzer with treemap visualization
 SpaceSniffer-RS is a disk space analysis tool featuring real-time treemap
 visualization. It scans directories and renders file sizes as nested
 rectangles using the squarified treemap algorithm, allowing users to
 quickly identify large files and folders.
 .
 Features include:
  * Real-time scanning with progressive treemap rendering
  * Directory drill-down with breadcrumb navigation
  * Right-click context menu (open file location, delete)
  * Color-coded file categories
  * Built-in CJK font support
  * SVG window icon
